C('Awesome Single Cell','https://github.com/seandavi/awesome-single-cell','tools + resources',['单细胞分析的广泛工具与资源导航。','Broad navigation across single-cell tools and resources.']),
C('scRNA-tools','https://www.scrna-tools.org/','tools catalog',['可按任务查工具；工具收录并不代表最佳性能。','Find tools by task; inclusion is not proof of superior performance.'])
